channel-opacity is-style-wide\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"\/>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mystical\/Cynical<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Hosted by Daren Magee and Jaymee Carpenter, this podcast is a humorous, sincere, and rare exhibition of male vulnerability and heart-warming friendship, attempting to establish harmonious connections between cynicism and optimism, and the potential of an atheist\/agnostic to recognize the mystical qualities within everyday life.<\/p>\n\n\n\t\t\t<style type=\"text\/css\"><\/style>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"pp-podcast-9796\" class=\"pp-podcast has-header header-hidden has-featured playerview media-audio\"  data-teaser=\"\" data-elength=\"18\" data-eunit=\"\" data-ppsdata=\"{&quot;ppe-9796-1&quot;:{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Ep. 39 &#8211; &#8220;De-Platforming Fame&#8221; (Series Finale)&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;After 5 years and 3 Seasons, we&amp;apos;ve decided to leave on a loving high note. This show has been an incredible love project over the course of 5 years, our attempt at a love letter to humanity. We both feel there is no other show like this in the world, and we are both so proud of the road map to healing we&amp;apos;re leaving behind. We thank you for having us into your minds and hearts, and hope you start your own love projects while you still can.\\u00a0&lt;\\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;edit\\\/production\\\/opening &amp; closing music by &lt;b&gt;Jaymee Carpenter&lt;\\\/b&gt;&lt;\\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Help support the show at: &lt;b&gt;www.patreon.com\\\/mysticalcynical\\u00a0&lt;\\\/b&gt;&lt;\\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Find Jaymee: &lt;b&gt;www.loveistheauthor.com&lt;\\\/b&gt;&lt;\\\/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Find Daren: &lt;b&gt;www.realfunwow.